ZERO EXTERNAL MODULE DEPENDENCIES

The Go module (go.mod) has zero `require` directives. All third-party code
is vendored into the `internal/` directory. The software can be built and
run in air-gapped environments without network connectivity.

Two build modes are supported:
  - CGO_ENABLED=1: Full neural threat detection (default in Docker)
  - CGO_ENABLED=0: Heuristic-only fallback (smaller image, no ONNX)